s":"lane"},{"name":"Bahía course (Nicklaus 2009)","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","source":"https://nicklausdesign.com/course/puntamita2/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"360° Banderas Bay views, a beach hole by the El Faro surf spot; the more technical of the two","si":"expedition","blurb":"360° Banderas Bay views, a beach hole by the El Faro surf spot; the more technical of the two","when":"December–April","commission":"golf package + resort","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition","ocean","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"evidenced","romance":"destination","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["package","hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Islas Marietas — Playa del Amor","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Islas_Marietas_National_Park (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"December–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"SEMARNAT-permitted crater beach reached by swimming a cave tunnel; ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, ~15-min boat","si":"expedition","blurb":"SEMARNAT-permitted crater beach reached by swimming a cave tunnel; ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, ~15-min boat","when":"December–April","commission":"SEMARNAT-permitted operator (non-commissionable park fee) + resort night","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities","move"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["expedition","ocean","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"evidenced","romance":"destination","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["operator","hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Humpback whale-watching, Banderas Bay","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","source":"https://villaexperience.com/whale-watching-punta-mita-guide-2026/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"300–500 humpbacks each Dec–Mar; El Anclote pier to sighting zones in 15–30 min","si":"expedition","blurb":"300–500 humpbacks each Dec–Mar; El Anclote pier to sighting zones in 15–30 min","commission":"licensed operator + Fora/Virtuoso resort","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"destination","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator","consortia","hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"El Anclote / La Lancha surf","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","source":"https://wildmex.com/activities/surfing-punta-mita-surf-lessons/ (Accessed 2026-07-07)","hook":"Beginner cove + the region''s best peeling waves; guided lessons $60–180 depending on group/private","si":"expedition","blurb":"Beginner cove + the region''s best peeling waves; guided lessons $60–180 depending on group/private","commission":"surf school (affiliate/DMC) + resort","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition","ocean"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"evidenced","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate","hotel","school"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Rip currents and dengue, not crime. The Pacific beaches have rip currents and shore break — swim guarded resort beaches and obey the flags — and Nayarit is a high-prevalence dengue state with a May–November transmission peak, so pack repellent for summer stays. Nearest full trauma is Puerto Vallarta (~40 min), then US air-evac.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is Punta Mita good for a destination wedding?","a":"It is one of Mexico''s ultra-wedding flagships. Susurros del Corazón (Auberge) alone hosts events for 30–300 guests ~45 minutes from PVR, with reception rental from $2,000, alongside Four Seasons and St. Regis event teams. Villa and resort weddings book 9–12 months out — peak-season cohorts 12+ months.","source":"aubergeresorts.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s the best beach and surf for beginners?","a":"El Anclote. It''s a sheltered, sandy-bottom cove with gentle rolling waves — the peninsula''s beginner classroom — while La Lancha, a ~10-minute jungle-trail walk away, holds the most reliable quality waves for confident beginners through intermediates. Guided lessons ($60–180) stage away from the rocks.","source":"thesurfatlas.com / wildmex.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"Is the golf as good as they say?","a":"Yes — it''s a two-course Nicklaus complex with a genuine one-of-a-kind hole. The Pacífico course (7,104-yd par-72, eight ocean holes) has the \"Tail of the Whale,\" the world''s only natural-island green, 199 yards offshore and walkable at low tide; the 2009 Bahía course is the more technical of the two.","source":"nicklausdesign.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"How do I actually visit the Islas Marietas Hidden Beach?","a":"Only with a SEMARNAT-permitted operator, and book weeks ahead. Playa del Amor is capped at ~116 visitors/day, Wed–Sun, reached by a ~15-minute boat then a life-jacketed swim through a low cave tunnel; non-swimmers can''t access it. Never promise a landing without a confirmed permitted slot.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"ocean-adventures-—-future"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Punta Mita, Mexico — Ultra-Luxury Resorts, Private Villas & Whale Season | TravelWell","search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["Punta Mita resorts","villas Punta Mita","Four Seasons Punta Mita","bodas Punta Mita","avistamiento de ballenas Riviera Nayarit","Islas Marietas Playa del Amor","golf Punta Mita"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristD